      "jinshu:053:s0074 introduces the prince’s retrospective letter; s0104 again names 小婢承福持筆研墨黃紙來，使寫. This is the same letter episode already narrated in s0047, not evidence for another maid or an independent genuine imperial command. Chengfu versus Cheng Fu is only English spacing, while both current records preserve 承福."
    ],
